# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# VAANJAY (வாஞ்செய்) — Environment Variables
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# App
APP_NAME=VAANJAY
APP_ENV=development
APP_PORT=8080
APP_URL=http://localhost:8080
WEB_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Database
DATABASE_HOST=localhost
DATABASE_PORT=5432
DATABASE_NAME=vaanjay
DATABASE_USER=vaanjay_dev
DATABASE_PASSWORD=change_me_in_production
DATABASE_SSLMODE=disable

# Redis
REDIS_HOST=localhost
REDIS_PORT=6379
REDIS_PASSWORD=
REDIS_DB=0

# JWT
JWT_ACCESS_SECRET=your-access-secret-min-32-chars-long
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=your-refresh-secret-min-32-chars-long
JWT_ACCESS_EXPIRY=15m
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRY=720h

# OTP (MSG91 or Twilio)
OTP_PROVIDER=msg91
MSG91_AUTH_KEY=your_msg91_auth_key
MSG91_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=your_twilio_sid
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=your_twilio_token
TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=+1234567890

# Cloudflare R2 (S3-compatible)
R2_ACCOUNT_ID=your_account_id
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your_access_key
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your_secret_key
R2_BUCKET_NAME=vaanjay-media
R2_PUBLIC_URL=https://pub-xxxxx.r2.dev
R2_REGION=auto

# Firebase Cloud Messaging
FCM_SERVER_KEY=your_fcm_server_key
FCM_PROJECT_ID=vaanjay-xxx

# Razorpay
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=your_razorpay_key
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=your_razorpay_secret
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your_webhook_secret

# WebSocket
WS_PORT=8081
WS_MAX_CONN=10000

# WebRTC
RTC_PORT=8082
RTC_STUN_SERVER=stun:stun.l.google.com:19302
RTC_TURN_SERVER=turn:turn.vaanjay.com:3478
RTC_TURN_USERNAME=vaanjay
RTC_TURN_CREDENTIAL=change_me

# Rate Limiting
RATE_LIMIT_AUTH=5
RATE_LIMIT_GENERAL=100
RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW=60

# Admin
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@vaanjay.com
ADMIN_PASSWORD=change_me_admin_pass

# Feature Flags
ENABLE_PAYMENTS=true
ENABLE_LIVE_STREAMS=true
ENABLE_CALLS=true
ENABLE_CREATOR_MONETIZATION=true
MAINTENANCE_MODE=false

# CORS
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:3001,https://vaanjay.com
